[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3348802964","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111034#issuecomment-3348802964","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111034","id":3348802964,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Hmq2U","user":{"login":"MBCX","id":63003002,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMDAzMDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63003002?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX","html_url":"https://github.com/MBCX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-29T19:51:24Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T19:51:24Z","body":"> Can you remove the `Color` related changes from this PR. They don't seem relevant to the addition of risc-v support.\r\n\r\nWill split Color::from_hsv() fixes into a separate PR. For context, those fix incorrect usage \r\n(calling static method on temporary instance) exposed by newer Clang warnings.\r\n\r\n```\r\neditor\\themes\\editor_theme_manager.cpp:539:68: warning: ignoring temporary of type 'Color' declared with 'nodiscard' attribute [-Wunused-value]\r\n  539 |                 p_theme->set_color(\"property_color_x\", EditorStringName(Editor), Color().from_hsv(0.0 / 3.0 + 0.05, prop_color_saturation, prop_color_value));\r\n      |                                                                                  ^~~~~~~\r\neditor\\themes\\editor_theme_manager.cpp:540:68: warning: ignoring temporary of type 'Color' declared with 'nodiscard' attribute [-Wunused-value]\r\n  540 |                 p_theme->set_color(\"property_color_y\", EditorStringName(Editor), Color().from_hsv(1.0 / 3.0 + 0.05, prop_color_saturation, prop_color_value));\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3348802964/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3348837381","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111034#issuecomment-3348837381","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111034","id":3348837381,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HmzQF","user":{"login":"MBCX","id":63003002,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMDAzMDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63003002?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX","html_url":"https://github.com/MBCX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-29T20:00:37Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T20:00:37Z","body":"Removed the `Color::` changes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3348837381/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3349048433","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111034#issuecomment-3349048433","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111034","id":3349048433,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Hnmxx","user":{"login":"MBCX","id":63003002,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMDAzMDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63003002?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX","html_url":"https://github.com/MBCX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-29T21:03:13Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T21:03:58Z","body":"I'll convert this PR to a draft for now. After a little bit of digging, I found out that the NDK (27) specifically states that:\r\n\r\n> A RISC-V sysroot (AKA riscv64, or rv64) has been added. **It is not supported.** It is present to aid bringup for OS vendors, **but it's not yet a supported Android ABI**. It will not be built by default.\r\n\r\n(emphasis mine)\r\n\r\nSo in other words, the platform's own tooling itself isn't actually ready yet 😅 (even if it is included secretly and compiles correctly). I jumped on the bandwagon way, way too early and that's on me.\r\n\r\nI'll monitor the [android-riscv64](https://github.com/google/android-riscv64) repo, official NDK releases and RISC-V news. And when RISC-V becomes an officially supported ABI, I can revive this PR accordingly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3349048433/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3351102205","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111034#issuecomment-3351102205","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111034","id":3351102205,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HvcL9","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T10:07:56Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T10:07:56Z","body":"> So in other words, the platform's own tooling itself isn't actually ready yet 😅 (even if it is included secretly and compiles correctly). I jumped on the bandwagon way, way too early and that's on me.\r\n\r\nIs there any hardware available for testing? OpenGL ES 3 or Vulkan 1.0.\r\n\r\nWe're already experiencing various issues with GPU drivers on ARM32/ARM64 devices. It's hard to imagine we'll find enough new volunteer users and developers to test it and implement workarounds.\r\n\r\n> Qualcomm to Bring RISC-V Based Wearable Platform to Wear OS by Google\r\n\r\nhttps://www.qualcomm.com/news/releases/2023/10/qualcomm-to-bring-risc-v-based-wearable-platform-to--wear-os-by-\r\n\r\n3 weeks ago I tested a Godot 2D project on Firebase test lab on a smartwatch (\"Wear OS\" but arm64, I think). I saw the Godot logo for 3 seconds, after 10 seconds the screen was black and the test aborted.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3351102205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3351262173","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111034#issuecomment-3351262173","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111034","id":3351262173,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HwDPd","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T10:35:24Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T10:35:24Z","body":"Since it's not something that's actionable now or possibly in the near future, I'd suggest we close the PR to reduce the backlog, and instead open a proposal to keep track of RISC-V support for Android, so we're ready for it once it's fully supported in the NDK and devices start rolling out. The proposal can link back to this (then closed) PR for reference on the implementation, so we could later restart from this code.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3351262173/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3351346494","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111034#issuecomment-3351346494","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111034","id":3351346494,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HwX0-","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T10:51:34Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T10:51:34Z","body":"> Since it's not something that's actionable now or possibly in the near future, I'd suggest we close the PR to reduce the backlog, and instead open a proposal to keep track of RISC-V support for Android, so we're ready for it once it's fully supported in the NDK and devices start rolling out. The proposal can link back to this (then closed) PR for reference on the implementation, so we could later restart from this code.\r\n\r\nYeah, I agree.\r\nOP has already created a proposal for it https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13300","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3351346494/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]